+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Fixed
+
+- An empty `OVERLEAF_BASE_URL` or `OVERLEAF_COOKIE_JAR_FILE`, or one holding only spaces, now
+  counts as unset and takes its default, as the list and folder variables already did. The same
+  holds for `OVERLEAF_BROWSER_PATH`, `OVERLEAF_BROWSER_PROFILE_DIR`, `OVERLEAF_PROTOCOL_VERSIONS`,
+  the numeric variables, `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` and `APPDATA`. A launcher that passes every declared
+  variable no longer stops the server with "OVERLEAF_BASE_URL is invalid." for a setting nobody
+  set. A malformed value that is not empty is still refused.
+
